flowchart LR
  USER[External entity: User] -->|claim fields and questions| P1((1. Enter claim))
  P1 --> D1[(React component state: active claim)]
  D1 --> P2((2. Validate claim))
  P2 -->|errors| USER
  P2 -->|valid claim| P3((3. Evaluate local rules))
  P3 --> D2[(Baseline result in React state)]
  D2 --> P4((4. Optional AI enrichment))
  D3[(localStorage: Gemini key)] --> P4
  P4 -->|prompt| GEMINI[External system: Gemini API]
  GEMINI -->|generated output| P4
  P4 --> D2
  D2 --> P5((5. Render result))
  P5 --> USER
  USER --> P6((6. Copilot question))
  D2 --> P6
  P6 --> GEMINI
  GEMINI --> P6
  P6 --> USER
